magic
tech scmos
timestamp 100
<< metal1 >>
rect 0 0 10 10
<< labels >>
port 9 n
rlabel metal1 1 1 1 1 0 p2
port 1 n
rlabel metal1 2 2 2 2 0 p3
port 2 n signal
rlabel metal1 3 3 3 3 0 p4
port 3 n signal input
rlabel metal1 4 4 4 4 0 p5
port 4 n power inout abutment
port 5 e
rlabel metal1 5 5 5 5 0 unk
port 6 n bogususe bogusclass bogusshape
<< end >>
